We are just leaving the showcase.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.850
I got a chance to play the Lego Forza game

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:31.300
and get in the McLaren Lego car.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:33.160
- [Jenna] I was a little worried
about you getting in that.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.160
- So what was your favorite thing you saw

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:34.993
at the press conference?

00:13:34.993 --> 00:13:37.380
- Besides Keanu Reeves
coming out on stage,

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:39.523
and announcing Cyberpunk,

00:13:40.432 --> 00:13:41.380
everyone was losing their mind.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:44.570
I have to say that Gears looks
really, really incredible.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:45.830
Project Scarlett, Halo.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.550
- I'm excited about
that and I look forward

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:48.800
to more fun stuff from E3.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.440
So with that, I'll see you guys later.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.280
Go check out Jenna's channel and

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.190
that's it.
- Have a good day.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.206
- You have a good day.

00:13:57.206 --> 00:13:59.789
(upbeat music)

